==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|aɪə(r)|lang=en}}
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈæmpləfaɪə/|lang=en}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈæmpləfaɪɚ/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Anything that [[amplify|amplifies]], or makes something [[larger]] or more [[intense]].
# {{cx|linguistics|lang=en}} An [[adverb]] that adds intensity, such as "really" or "totally".
# {{context|electronics|lang=en}} An [[appliance]] or [[circuit]] that increases the [[strength]] of a weak [[electricity|electrical]] [[signal]] without changing the other characteristics of the signal.
# {{context|music|lang=en}} A portable [[encasement]] that houses a large [[speaker]], used to amplify voices and [[musical instrument]]s at live performances.<!--{{rfphoto}}?-->

